{"id": "parity-pubkey-cat", "payload": {"kind": "command", "value": "cat ~/.ssh/id_ed25519.pub"}, "expect": "allow", "source": "parity", "why": "a public key holds no secret; deny_read on ~/.ssh/** has an allow_read carve-out for public keys, the ssh config and known hosts"}
